#HELPS
1 GNAAR MOK~
Gnaar Mok is a poor fishing village built amid the marshes of the Bitter Coast
where weathered shacks and narrow walkways gather beside a small quiet harbor.
Fisherfolk, thieves and local thugs share the settlement's few humble services
as mist and brackish water surround its lonely wooden homes.~
